% test: head_pair_integer_to_constant
% expected: pass
% description: A variable copied within a head: the input's type within the
%   output's (TGLP b927b41, Definition "Well-Typed Clause with Subtyping",
%   clause (a): "if both occur in the head, the dual of the type of X is a
%   subtype of the type of X?").  Copying an Integer input to a Constant
%   output is well-typed, Integer <: Constant.  Negative twin:
%   negative/subtyping/head_pair_constant_to_integer.glp.
%   Constant is the root self.glp union Number ; String ; Module.

procedure elem(Integer?, Constant).
elem(X, X?).
